3
00:19:35,294 --> 00:19:41,294
When El, an aspiring sneaker designer from Queens, meets Kira King, the fiercely independent daughter of legendary
basketball star and sneaker tycoon Darius King, sparks fly as the two bond over their mutual affinity for sneakers.

4
00:26:07,058 --> 00:26:13,058
With a little nudge from his best friend and a sprinkle of Fairy Godfather magic, El finds the courage to
use his talent to pursue his dream of becoming a ‘legit’ sneaker designer in the industry.

