11
01:11:49,411 --> 01:11:55,411
Sneakerella is a 2022 American musical comedy film directed by Elizabeth Allen Rosenbaum and
written by David Light & Joseph Raso, Tamara Chestna, Mindy Stern, and George Gore II.

12
01:18:21,176 --> 01:18:27,176
A re-imagining of the classic fairy tale Cinderella, the film stars Chosen Jacobs, Lexi Underwood, Devyn Nekoda, Bryan
Terrell Clark, Kolton Stewart, Hayward Leach, Robyn Alomar, Yvonne Senat Jones, Juan Chioran, and John Salley.

13
01:24:52,941 --> 01:24:58,941
Produced by Disney Channel and Jane Startz Productions, the
film was released on Disney+ on May 13, 2022.

14
01:31:24,705 --> 01:31:30,705
The film received generally positive reviews from critics.

15
01:37:56,470 --> 01:38:02,470
Sneakerella was nominated for 11 Children's and Family Emmy Awards at its inaugural ceremony, winning four awards
including Outstanding Fiction Special and Outstanding Music Direction and Composition for a Live Action Program.

16
01:44:28,235 --> 01:44:34,235
The tone is lighthearted.
